# Hints (hints.rs, Research round 4)
config.base.hints = Hints
config.base.hints.tooltip = Short tips under the crosshair when something new happens: the cold, an empty stomach, night coming
hint.base.logs = Hold {key:core:attack} on a tree trunk to get logs.
hint.base.table = Press {key:core:inventory}: logs make planks, planks a crafting table, and logs and sticks a campfire.
hint.base.night = Night falls about {0}:00, and monsters come out in the dark. Build a campfire (two logs, two sticks): no monster appears in its light, and it warms you.
hint.base.cold = Getting cold. Stand by a fire, get out of the wind, or wear warmer clothes.
hint.base.freezing = Freezing: you are losing health. Get to a fire, or dig into the ground.
hint.base.wet = Wet clothes keep little warmth. Dry off under a roof or by a fire.
hint.base.empty = Your stomach is empty: you can't reach full health or stamina. Eat meat, berries or bread.
hint.base.raw_meat = Raw meat is better cooked. A campfire or a furnace cooks it, and hot food warms you.
hint.base.grave = Your things are in a tombstone where you died: x {0}, z {1}.
hint.base.hot = Too hot. Find shade or water, and take off warm clothes.
hint.base.rest = Under a roof by a fire you rest, and wake Rested.

